sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor A as Masyarakat
participant UI as Antarmuka Web
participant APP as PublicController
participant DB as Basis Data
A->>UI: Membuka portal
UI->>APP: Meminta halaman publik
APP->>DB: Mengambil profil dan layanan aktif
DB->>APP: Mengembalikan data
APP-->>UI: Merender halaman
UI-->>A: Menampilkan informasi layanan